# "Whenever a Food is put into a graveyard from the battlefield" counts any Food, not only the creatures Ygra makes Foods:
# Oko, Thief of Crowns' +2 makes a Food token, a noncreature artifact Ygra's static ability leaves alone: it has no
# "Sacrifice this permanent" of Ygra's (the refusal), only its own "Sacrifice this token". Sacrificed for its own ability,
# it goes to the graveyard (CR 111.7, 704.5d) and Ygra gets two +1/+1 counters.

